## PR-Tier Cost & Integration

* **Measured baseline costs in this repo:**
  - `scripts/proofs/axioms.sh` (`lake env lean scripts/proofs/theorems.lean` over the pre-built `ConcreteSpec` environment): **~0.8s**.
  - `scripts/spec/rules.sh` (copies `ConcreteSpec`, runs `lean_lex.py examples`, elaborates `ConcreteSpec.Spec` + `rules.lean`): **~4s** when `.olean` cache is warm.
* **Cost of the unified `vacuity.sh` gate:**
  - When `rules.sh` and `vacuity.sh` share the single `lean_lex.py examples` elaboration of `ConcreteSpec` (incremental over `.lake/build` from `lake build`), elaborating the rewritten `example`s in `ConcreteSpec/{Spec,Proofs}` + running `vacuity.lean` in `MetaM` over all ~509 user theorems and ~320 examples takes **~3–5 seconds** total, plus **~1.5 seconds** for the 9-control batch self-test (**~5–6.5s total**, well within the PR-tier fast surface gate budget).

